                <mxCell id="15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Using The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;supervisory guidance check if the &quot;must read papers&quot; appear in the results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;All papers present except for 3 which are:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;M10&lt;/b&gt; - Computing the Worst Case Execution Time of an Avionics Program by Abstract Interpretation (Not Part of the databases)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;M16&lt;/b&gt; - Leroy, X. (2009). Formal Verification of a Realistic Compiler. (ACM)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;M17&lt;/b&gt; - Qualifying CompCert for Safety-Critical Avionics Software (Not Part of the databases)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fillColor=#fad7ac;strokeColor=#b46504;fontColor=light-dark(#030303, #ededed);" parent="1" vertex="1">
