                <mxCell id="19" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: start;&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note.&lt;/b&gt; Paper filtering was performed using a custom Python script (&quot;apply_filter.py&quot;, in &quot;slr/searches/filter&quot;), configured via a &quot;config.json&quot; file. Filtering was based on three criteria: (1) a keyword list, (2) an exclude-keyword list (which takes precedence over the keyword list), (3) and a must-keep list of papers retained regardless of the other two&lt;/p&gt;" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=center;fillColor=#fad7ac;strokeColor=#b46504;" parent="45" vertex="1">
